Thought: Test a robust median over the larger pool3 to see if it outperforms mean pool2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full model set to see if trimming helps reduce correlated errors.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

